{"id":"vod_hh_61061","vodId":"61061","provider":"hh","providerName":"豪华资源","type":2,"name":"四月一日灵异事件簿","name_cn":"四月一日灵异事件簿","date":"2006-01-01","year":"2006","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第24集","images":{"common":"https://hhmage.com/cover/615a666e6472b587f63193032da45961.jpg"},"summary":"高中生四月一日君寻（福山润 配音）有着令他十分困扰的灵异体质，他总是能在不知不觉的情况下吸引大量的灵体。一日，偶然中他踏进了一间魔法商店，遇见了美丽神秘的店主壹原郁子（大原沙耶香 配音）。郁子告诉他这是一件帮人达成愿望的商店，四月一日君寻遂许下了希望能解除特异体质的愿望，可是这愿望售价昂贵，四月一日君寻不得不在店里打工来付清欠款。此间，他结实了沉默寡言的白目鬼静（中井和哉 配音）、厄运缠身的九轩葵（伊藤静 配音），以及一只造型怪异的名叫魔可拿的宠物。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-06-18 14:30:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"hhm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Le3vARrd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8AVPld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/rb2rMzJb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/yb8AJ8ld/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/penX1n4b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QeZy1qvd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/qaQmMZ7a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/zbq51w3b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/1aKBpXre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/Rb4wOE2a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/kaz5kVre/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXwWmkd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/nelL1jle/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/RdGxl6Qe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/QbYxKp0a/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第16集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/BeXwJxkd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第17集","url":"https://play.hhuus.com/play/YaOkKVga/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第18集","url":"https://play.hhuus.c